{"2922630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chicken Chicken", "steam_appid": 2922630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.poster.avif?t=1784311679\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.webm?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.mp4?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six wild mini-games throw you and your friends into situations where things spiral out of control fast and adaptation is the only way to win!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nest</strong>. Collect eggs, bring them to the nest, and defend it against relentless waves of enemies, solo or in co-op. Keep your focus, react quickly, and survive as the waves become faster, tougher, and more overwhelming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglimination</strong>. Two teams of armed chickens face off in round-based battles, choosing new perks between rounds to reshape their strategy. Adapt fast, counter smart, and outplay the other side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bull</strong>. Chickens must deliver sacks to the finish line while a player-controlled bull charges around to ruin everyone else’s plans. Asymmetrical chaos where timing and positioning mean everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of Junkyard</strong>. Scale a towering pile of trash as fast as possible. One slip can cost you the lead, and momentum is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swamp</strong>. Two teams, one swamp, and very heavy flying chicks tied to you with ropes. Work together to drag, position, and feed them eggs while the terrain fights you every step of the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong>. Control your vehicle with dance game controls and try to finish with as many sacks of grain as you can. Precision and tempo decide who tips over and who takes first place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, embrace the chaos, and see who survives this feathery anarchy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.poster.avif?t=1784311679\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.webm?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.mp4?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.poster.avif?t=1784311679\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.webm?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f111ec1bb83f0e9078435ce2dde3f5bb.mp4?t=1784311679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six wild mini-games throw you and your friends into situations where things spiral out of control fast and adaptation is the only way to win!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nest</strong>. Collect eggs, bring them to the nest, and defend it against relentless waves of enemies, solo or in co-op. Keep your focus, react quickly, and survive as the waves become faster, tougher, and more overwhelming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglimination</strong>. Two teams of armed chickens face off in round-based battles, choosing new perks between rounds to reshape their strategy. Adapt fast, counter smart, and outplay the other side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bull</strong>. Chickens must deliver sacks to the finish line while a player-controlled bull charges around to ruin everyone else’s plans. Asymmetrical chaos where timing and positioning mean everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>King of Junkyard</strong>. Scale a towering pile of trash as fast as possible. One slip can cost you the lead, and momentum is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swamp</strong>. Two teams, one swamp, and very heavy flying chicks tied to you with ropes. Work together to drag, position, and feed them eggs while the terrain fights you every step of the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong>. Control your vehicle with dance game controls and try to finish with as many sacks of grain as you can. Precision and tempo decide who tips over and who takes first place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends, embrace the chaos, and see who survives this feathery anarchy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922630/extras/f981326408a18fea9934a8804cfa3669.poster.avif?t=1784311679\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/29